- if @report_data.blank?
  %h4 No fixed-route runs in this range
- else
  :css
    .fc-issue { color: #a94442; font-weight: bold; }
    .fc-ok { color: #3c763d; }
    .fc-detail { background: #f9f9f9; font-size: 12px; }
    .fc-detail td { padding-left: 24px !important; }
    .fc-num { text-align: right; }
  :javascript
    function fcToggle(id) { var el = document.getElementById(id); if (el) el.style.display = el.style.display === 'none' ? '' : 'none'; return false; }
  %p
    %b Runs:
    = @grand[:runs]
    &nbsp;&nbsp;
    %b Clean:
    %span{class: (@grand[:clean] == @grand[:runs] ? 'fc-ok' : '')}= @grand[:clean]
    &nbsp;&nbsp;
    %b Stops served:
    = @grand[:served]
    &nbsp;&nbsp;
    %b Skipped:
    %span{class: (@grand[:skipped] > 0 ? 'fc-issue' : 'fc-ok')}= @grand[:skipped]
    - if @grand[:skip_rate]
      = "(#{@grand[:skip_rate]}%)"
    &nbsp;&nbsp;
    %b Early departures:
    %span{class: (@grand[:early] > 0 ? 'fc-issue' : 'fc-ok')}= @grand[:early]
    &nbsp;&nbsp;
    %b Missing pre-trip:
    %span{class: (@grand[:no_pre] > 0 ? 'fc-issue' : 'fc-ok')}= @grand[:no_pre]
    &nbsp;&nbsp;
    %b Missing post-trip:
    %span{class: (@grand[:no_post] > 0 ? 'fc-issue' : 'fc-ok')}= @grand[:no_post]
    &nbsp;&nbsp;
    %b Riders:
    = @grand[:boarded]
    &nbsp;&nbsp;
    %b Miles:
    = @grand[:miles]
    &nbsp;&nbsp;
    %b Days:
    = @grand[:days]
  %p{style: 'color: #777; font-size: 12px;'}
    Stops served and skipped come from the tablet (GCRPC Fixed Route), which records a stop as served when the bus comes to rest within 40 m of it.
    Early means the bus left a stop more than 30 seconds before its published time; late means more than 5 minutes after.
    A run with no stop data was driven with a tablet that sent nothing, or on an older app.
  - @report_data.each do |route_name, rows|
    %h3.vehicle-heading
      %u= "Route: #{route_name}"
    %table.table.table-condensed{style: 'margin-bottom: 14px;'}
      %thead
        %tr
          %th Date
          %th Run
          %th Driver
          %th Bus
          %th Out / In
          %th.fc-num Miles
          %th.fc-num Trips
          %th.fc-num Served
          %th.fc-num Skipped
          %th.fc-num Early
          %th.fc-num Late
          %th.fc-num Dwell
          %th.fc-num Riders
          %th.fc-num Fares
          %th Pre
          %th Post
          %th Issues
      %tbody
        - rows.each_with_index do |r, i|
          - det = "fc-#{r.run.id}"
          - has_detail = r.skipped_list.any? || r.early_list.any?
          %tr
            %td= r.date.strftime('%a %m/%d')
            %td
              = r.run_name
              - if has_detail
                = link_to 'details', '#', onclick: "return fcToggle('#{det}')", style: 'font-size: 11px; margin-left: 6px;'
            %td= r.driver_name
            %td= r.vehicle_name
            %td= [r.started_at&.strftime('%H:%M'), r.ended_at&.strftime('%H:%M')].compact.join(' / ')
            %td.fc-num= r.miles
            %td.fc-num= r.trips
            %td.fc-num= r.stops_served
            %td.fc-num{class: (r.stops_skipped > 0 ? 'fc-issue' : '')}= r.stops_skipped
            %td.fc-num{class: (r.early > 0 ? 'fc-issue' : '')}= r.early
            %td.fc-num= r.late
            %td.fc-num= r.avg_dwell ? "#{r.avg_dwell}s" : ''
            %td.fc-num= r.boarded
            %td.fc-num= r.fares > 0 ? number_to_currency(r.fares) : ''
            %td{class: (r.pre_trip ? 'fc-ok' : 'fc-issue')}= r.pre_trip ? (r.pre_trip.safe_to_operate == false ? 'UNSAFE' : 'yes') : 'no'
            %td{class: (r.post_trip ? 'fc-ok' : (r.issues.include?('no post-trip') ? 'fc-issue' : ''))}= r.post_trip ? (r.post_trip.safe_to_operate == false ? 'UNSAFE' : 'yes') : (r.ended_at ? 'no' : 'out')
            %td{class: (r.issues.empty? ? 'fc-ok' : 'fc-issue')}= r.issues.empty? ? 'clean' : r.issues.join(', ')
          - if has_detail
            %tr.fc-detail{id: det, style: 'display: none;'}
              %td{colspan: 17}
                - if r.skipped_list.any?
                  %b Skipped stops:
                  %ul{style: 'margin: 2px 0 6px;'}
                    - r.skipped_list.each do |x|
                      %li= "#{x[:stop]} (#{x[:trip]}#{x[:scheduled] ? ", published #{x[:scheduled]}" : ''}#{x[:passed] ? ", passed #{x[:passed].strftime('%H:%M')}" : ''})"
                - if r.early_list.any?
                  %b Early departures:
                  %ul{style: 'margin: 2px 0 0;'}
                    - r.early_list.each do |x|
                      %li= "#{x[:stop]} (#{x[:trip]}): published #{x[:scheduled]}, left #{x[:left]&.strftime('%H:%M')}, #{x[:minutes]} min early"
